WEBVTT

01:38.040 --> 01:40.000
NANZHAO BROCADE…

01:40.600 --> 01:43.440
If, within a year,
you can weave Nanzhao Brocade,

01:43.520 --> 01:46.240
I will have someone escort you all back.

01:46.760 --> 01:48.240
If you cannot,

01:49.520 --> 01:52.280
for every day you delay,
ten lives will be lost.

01:54.400 --> 01:56.000
Starting next month,

01:56.080 --> 01:58.080
50 bolts of brocade
must be delivered each month.

01:58.600 --> 02:00.320
If you fail,

02:00.840 --> 02:04.320
my blade will move faster
than a Qingping officer.

02:10.440 --> 02:11.520
Ji Yingying,

02:11.600 --> 02:15.480
I'm counting on you
for the rest of my life.

03:46.680 --> 03:47.680
Yang Jinglan?

04:03.040 --> 04:04.920
Am I dreaming again?

04:12.680 --> 04:13.920
It is not a dream.

04:16.000 --> 04:17.160
It is me.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.080
Everything is all right…

04:39.080 --> 04:40.560
You really have come!

04:43.320 --> 04:44.520
Yes, I am here.

04:52.120 --> 04:53.480
How did you get here?

04:54.360 --> 04:55.920
It is dangerous here,

04:56.440 --> 04:58.680
far more dangerous
than either of us imagined.

04:58.760 --> 05:01.240
Yingying, come with me now.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.280
I will save the others after we leave.

05:02.880 --> 05:03.800
Let's go!

05:06.040 --> 05:07.040
Let's go!

05:12.400 --> 05:13.640
What is the matter?

05:15.880 --> 05:17.360
I cannot leave yet.

05:18.600 --> 05:19.880
I made a deal with the King of Nanzhao

05:19.960 --> 05:22.360
to weave Nanzhao Brocade within a year.

05:22.880 --> 05:26.320
If I leave now,
he will vent his wrath on the craftsmen.

05:27.800 --> 05:28.960
A year?

05:29.880 --> 05:31.080
Are you saying you will stay
in this forsaken place

05:31.160 --> 05:32.040
for an entire year?

05:36.680 --> 05:38.280
I have no other choice.

05:41.560 --> 05:43.080
I understand, Yingying.

05:43.160 --> 05:44.320
You had no choice before.

05:45.120 --> 05:47.160
But now that I am here, you do.

05:47.680 --> 05:48.840
Let's leave this place together.

05:48.920 --> 05:52.760
Nanzhao has always coveted Shu brocade,
yearning for it desperately.

05:52.840 --> 05:54.040
That is why the King of Nanzhao

05:54.120 --> 05:57.320
is willing to strike a deal
with someone as insignificant as me.

05:58.120 --> 05:59.600
What the King of Nanzhao seeks,

05:59.680 --> 06:02.080
neither Du Yan
nor Sheng Fengze can stop him.

06:03.280 --> 06:04.960
Du Yan cannot get us out of here.

06:09.080 --> 06:10.440
But, Yingying,

06:10.960 --> 06:12.800
right now, I only want

06:15.200 --> 06:16.720
to protect you.

06:29.560 --> 06:31.960
I do not want you to sacrifice yourself.

06:36.960 --> 06:39.480
I want you to always walk with honor,

06:41.360 --> 06:45.760
to be true to yourself
without guilt or regret.

06:46.480 --> 06:48.520
I want you to live
as the person you truly wish to be.

06:50.920 --> 06:52.320
I can achieve it

06:53.800 --> 06:55.400
in a year's time.

06:56.480 --> 06:59.240
Yang Jinglan, wait for me.

06:59.760 --> 07:00.720
Will you?

07:01.880 --> 07:03.600
You do not want me to sacrifice myself,

07:05.440 --> 07:07.000
but you would sacrifice yourself.

07:11.880 --> 07:12.920
Ji Yingying,

07:14.440 --> 07:18.120
when will you stop
trying to take the lead,

07:18.200 --> 07:22.040
thinking of others,
while disregarding your own safety?

07:23.600 --> 07:25.840
Can you think of yourself just for once?

07:28.360 --> 07:29.760
In order to stay alive

07:31.080 --> 07:33.040
and protect the craftsmen of Yizhou,

07:34.800 --> 07:37.120
I will have to make compromises.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.520
But do not worry.

07:46.880 --> 07:48.880
I am Ji Yingying.

07:50.520 --> 07:52.520
I will find a way to protect myself.

07:58.320 --> 08:00.400
It is my responsibility to ensure

08:02.000 --> 08:03.760
you have the confidence
to never compromise.

08:20.440 --> 08:23.160
I heard Niu Jin has been appointed
the military commissioner of Yizhou.

08:25.000 --> 08:27.440
Even if Nanzhao lets us go,
we may not be able to return home.

08:29.680 --> 08:30.920
Yang Jinglan,

08:31.560 --> 08:33.360
let's go back to how things used to be.

08:33.440 --> 08:34.600
Each of us doing what we are best at.

08:34.679 --> 08:35.640
All right?

08:36.880 --> 08:39.840
I will lead them in weaving
the brocade and take them home.

08:41.520 --> 08:44.120
You make sure we have a home to return to.

08:53.400 --> 08:54.280
All right.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.480
I will do as you say.

09:03.480 --> 09:06.040
I will handle the matter
with Niu Jin as soon as I can.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.560
So, you will have a home waiting for you.

09:41.280 --> 09:43.040
You did not take her with you.

09:44.280 --> 09:45.440
It looks like

09:46.080 --> 09:48.400
she still wants to be
the future princess of Nanzhao.

09:53.120 --> 09:54.480
Now is not the right time.

09:55.840 --> 09:57.000
I know.

09:57.080 --> 09:59.120
You do not want
a future princess from Yizhou

09:59.200 --> 10:01.040
in Prince Bai's Residence.

10:02.440 --> 10:03.840
Then, collaborate with me properly.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.600
Once it is done,

10:08.120 --> 10:11.200
I want you to take her away
and leave Nanzhao for good.

10:13.960 --> 10:15.880
PURE AND IMPURE, CLEAR AND MURKY

10:18.080 --> 10:19.120
Thank you.

10:24.720 --> 10:25.880
Sheng,

10:27.200 --> 10:29.600
I do not even know
if what I am doing is right.

10:30.480 --> 10:32.040
But I hope

10:33.200 --> 10:35.880
you are still the Prince Bai
of Nanzhao you once were.

10:39.920 --> 10:45.400
PRINCE BAI'S RESIDENCE

11:20.000 --> 11:23.000
Ms. Ji, His Highness
has sent breakfast for you.

11:23.520 --> 11:25.720
Shall I assist you
with your morning routine?

11:26.240 --> 11:27.400
I do not want to eat it.

11:29.080 --> 11:30.600
You do not want breakfast.

11:31.120 --> 11:34.440
Do you not want to discuss
the brocade with me as well?

11:51.320 --> 11:53.120
Come, porridge is being served!
Come and get it!

11:58.320 --> 11:59.520
Slow down…!

12:00.080 --> 12:02.000
Mister, slow down…! Thank you.

12:02.920 --> 12:04.640
- Here, eat something…!
- Here!

12:04.720 --> 12:05.680
You should eat.

12:07.680 --> 12:09.600
- Thank you.
- Come…!

12:09.680 --> 12:11.040
Porridge is being served! Come and get it!

12:11.120 --> 12:12.240
Here!

12:13.040 --> 12:14.280
Porridge is being served!

12:17.400 --> 12:18.440
Come, take your meals here!

12:18.520 --> 12:21.120
- Take your meals! Come!
- Thank you!

12:23.640 --> 12:26.080
All right…! Here! Let's go!

12:26.160 --> 12:28.800
All right. Let's talk about the brocade.

12:31.400 --> 12:32.480
Bring it in.

12:45.520 --> 12:47.120
These are rare ancient texts,

12:47.200 --> 12:49.600
verbal accounts
from master craftsmen, and patterns.

12:49.680 --> 12:51.240
They are all related to Shu brocade.

12:55.680 --> 12:58.080
SCROLL PATTERN

13:00.960 --> 13:02.200
These ancient texts…

13:03.440 --> 13:04.680
Even the brocade masters of Yizhou

13:04.760 --> 13:06.600
would not have
such an extensive collection.

13:09.680 --> 13:11.040
You have certainly been
planning this for a long time.

13:13.400 --> 13:14.760
The stagnation
of Nanzhao's brocade industry

13:14.840 --> 13:17.400
comes down to two main reasons.

13:17.480 --> 13:19.000
First, the technique.
Second, the materials.

13:19.080 --> 13:22.600
I have already devised a plan
for the technique.

13:22.680 --> 13:24.720
Those craftsmen carry
the techniques within them.

13:25.880 --> 13:29.320
As for materials,
I will need your help, Ms. Ji.

13:31.240 --> 13:33.960
Many materials can be sourced, actually.

13:38.800 --> 13:40.280
First is Huanhua Creek.

13:40.360 --> 13:43.120
The second is silk.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.880
The issue lies with
the silk's tensile strength.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.480
It is not durable enough

14:00.560 --> 14:02.120
to withstand thousands of lifts
required by the loom.

14:03.280 --> 14:05.120
This is silk spun
by Nanzhao's wild silkworms.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.480
Nanzhao's wild silkworms?

14:08.000 --> 14:10.160
Why not simply take
Shu silkworms and rear them here?

14:10.240 --> 14:11.640
They cannot survive here?

14:12.640 --> 14:14.560
They do survive, but over time,

14:14.640 --> 14:16.560
the Shu silkworms adapt
and turn into Nanzhao silkworms,

14:16.640 --> 14:20.120
and their silk becomes Nanzhao silk.

14:20.920 --> 14:22.160
Sometimes, I wonder

14:22.240 --> 14:26.120
if silkworms adapt to their surroundings
even faster than people do.

14:30.920 --> 14:32.120
This is not new silk.

14:32.200 --> 14:33.320
It is not.

14:34.080 --> 14:36.760
I began cultivating
wild silkworms three years ago.

14:36.840 --> 14:39.600
Nanzhao's silk
combined with Nanzhao's patterns

14:39.680 --> 14:41.680
is the Nanzhao Brocade my brother seeks.

14:42.280 --> 14:43.920
Once Nanzhao Brocade is completed,

14:44.000 --> 14:46.520
my brother will secure
his place in history,

14:47.040 --> 14:48.240
gaining both fame and fortune.

14:49.760 --> 14:53.240
I know you and I
are the same kind of person.

14:53.320 --> 14:55.000
We think alike.

14:55.080 --> 14:57.840
But you are too impatient.

14:58.480 --> 15:01.000
You are too impatient,
but my brother is even more so.

15:01.080 --> 15:03.760
One year is far too short.

15:05.040 --> 15:07.680
Your Highness, for something
that you have pursued for three years

15:07.760 --> 15:09.160
and still continue to do so,

15:09.240 --> 15:12.560
there must be a certainty of success
that keeps you going.

15:29.680 --> 15:30.680
Look at these.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.960
Are they not beautiful?

15:40.840 --> 15:42.280
They are Shu brocade from Tang Empire.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.200
Of course, they are beautiful.

15:44.400 --> 15:46.320
Now, look at this one.

16:01.880 --> 16:04.360
The patterns and techniques
are Shu brocade,

16:04.880 --> 16:07.560
but the texture and colors
are slightly different.

16:08.080 --> 16:09.400
The tensile strength,
however, is sufficient.

16:11.000 --> 16:12.640
This was made using silk
from Nanzhao's wild silkworms,

16:12.720 --> 16:13.800
then dyed and woven into brocade.

16:14.880 --> 16:16.520
Where is the person
who dyed and wove this?

16:19.320 --> 16:20.480
Dead.

16:27.800 --> 16:29.840
There was once a child.

16:30.360 --> 16:33.560
His mother was captured by his father

16:34.080 --> 16:35.640
and forced to be his wife.

16:38.440 --> 16:40.800
This brocade robe belonged to your mother.

16:44.480 --> 16:47.680
I lied to you before.

16:48.800 --> 16:51.680
This brocade was not something
my mother brought from her homeland.

16:52.200 --> 16:54.320
It was dyed and woven by someone
in Nanzhao who succeeded

16:54.400 --> 16:55.520
and gifted it to her.

16:58.520 --> 16:59.920
How long did it take that person?

17:01.520 --> 17:02.600
Ten years.

17:05.000 --> 17:08.119
Doesn't one year seem too short now?

17:09.400 --> 17:13.640
They say that person was her brother,

17:14.160 --> 17:15.640
but I know the truth.

17:15.720 --> 17:18.240
He was the man my mother truly loved.

17:18.760 --> 17:20.359
And my father knew it too.

17:22.760 --> 17:24.400
All right. Here is what we will do.

17:24.920 --> 17:27.480
I will take you to another place.

17:28.800 --> 17:29.640
Where to?

17:30.520 --> 17:33.240
That person adopted a child named Mu Lan.

17:33.320 --> 17:35.480
I will take you to see her.

17:51.280 --> 17:55.320
SHENG FENGZE AND OTHERS
ARE NOT ALLOWED TO ENTER

17:56.720 --> 17:59.520
Your Highness, even in Nanzhao,
there are deals you cannot make

17:59.600 --> 18:00.920
and people you cannot control?

18:12.120 --> 18:13.600
Anyone here?

18:17.680 --> 18:18.800
Anyone?

18:25.360 --> 18:27.200
Are these wild silkworms
the kind you have been cultivating?

18:30.120 --> 18:31.120
Do not touch them!

18:33.000 --> 18:35.360
If you were lying in bed,
sleeping peacefully,

18:35.440 --> 18:38.640
when suddenly a hand many times your size
descended from above to touch you,

18:38.720 --> 18:39.760
would you not be terrified?

18:39.840 --> 18:41.120
The silkworms feel the same.

18:50.160 --> 18:52.080
Did you not see the sign outside?

18:52.800 --> 18:55.200
Can you not read,
or did you change your name?

18:55.280 --> 18:57.760
This is Ms. Ji from Yizhou.

18:57.840 --> 18:59.720
She and her team were the ones

18:59.800 --> 19:01.360
who wove the Ripple Brocade
I showed you earlier.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.040
Are you illiterate too?

19:14.240 --> 19:16.080
Your gaze toward her is not exactly pure.

19:16.160 --> 19:18.240
But she looks at you more purely
than she would at the clouds.

19:19.000 --> 19:20.920
Why mimic your father, though?

19:21.000 --> 19:22.680
Of all things, why copy him
in stealing someone else's wife?

19:33.280 --> 19:35.120
Your clothes are beautiful.

19:35.200 --> 19:37.560
The colors are quite different
from other people of Nanzhao.

19:38.080 --> 19:39.280
Did you dye them yourself?

19:47.720 --> 19:49.440
We are not the same kind of people.

19:49.520 --> 19:51.280
No matter how much you talk,
it will not matter.

19:51.360 --> 19:52.720
Shut your lovely mouth.

20:01.320 --> 20:02.520
Even if we are not
the same kind of people,

20:02.600 --> 20:03.920
we can still walk the same path.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.840
I want to use your Nanzhao silk,

20:06.920 --> 20:09.400
combined with Shu brocade's techniques,
to create a new kind of brocade.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.760
One that belongs to Nanzhao.

20:12.600 --> 20:15.120
Do you know how many times
he has said those same things to me?

20:16.160 --> 20:18.000
Men deceiving women is in their nature.

20:18.080 --> 20:20.480
But when women deceive women,
that is just heartless.

20:20.560 --> 20:21.720
Young lady,

20:21.800 --> 20:23.400
I would advise you to stay away from him.

20:28.800 --> 20:30.160
This one has plenty of moisture.

20:30.240 --> 20:31.640
You can eat this today.

20:40.000 --> 20:42.680
If you keep feeding them this,
they will die.

20:43.920 --> 20:47.560
These leaves are too moist
and are not suitable for daytime feeding.

20:47.640 --> 20:49.800
Wild silkworms naturally forage freely.

20:49.880 --> 20:51.400
If you insist on raising them like this,

20:51.480 --> 20:54.680
you must understand
what they prefer to eat and when.

20:57.840 --> 21:01.080
Da Bai, stop stealing Pang Niu's food!

21:01.160 --> 21:03.440
Look at how much bigger you are than her!

21:08.240 --> 21:10.040
- This…
- This one is not bad.

21:10.120 --> 21:11.520
You can feed them this.

21:12.040 --> 21:14.400
But these still are not the best option.

21:14.480 --> 21:17.720
You should be feeding them
a leaf called Tian Bu Pa.

21:19.480 --> 21:20.320
Tian Bu Pa?

21:20.400 --> 21:22.440
You do not even know Tian Bu Pa leaves?

21:23.360 --> 21:25.200
Her skills at raising silkworms
are worse than mine.

21:25.280 --> 21:27.280
Let's go. This was a waste of time.

21:33.160 --> 21:34.840
I did not expect you
to have such knowledge

21:34.920 --> 21:36.200
in cultivating wild silkworms, Ms. Ji.

21:36.280 --> 21:38.080
I do not. I was just making things up.

21:39.240 --> 21:40.680
She lives in her own world.

21:40.760 --> 21:44.040
I need to bring her into my world
to truly communicate with her.

21:44.560 --> 21:45.600
Wait a moment.

21:48.480 --> 21:49.360
Is there something wrong?

21:49.440 --> 21:52.600
The leaf you just ate
grows next to poisonous mushrooms.

21:52.680 --> 21:54.000
It is toxic.

21:54.600 --> 21:57.040
People say my words are sharp,
but now your mouth is literally poisoned.

21:58.520 --> 21:59.440
How do we detoxify it?

22:11.680 --> 22:13.240
What did you give her to drink?

22:13.320 --> 22:15.560
Just something bad.
She will be fine once she vomits.

22:16.400 --> 22:17.280
But in a while,

22:17.360 --> 22:19.320
she might start seeing things
she should not.

22:22.960 --> 22:24.040
Your Highness,

22:24.760 --> 22:27.520
there have been some absurd rumors
in the city lately.

22:27.600 --> 22:30.400
Some say Ji Yingying
is a spring silkworm turned spirit,

22:30.480 --> 22:31.640
or even the reincarnation of Leizu.

22:32.160 --> 22:34.120
They claim you were moved
by a divine vision

22:34.640 --> 22:36.840
to bring her into
your residence for worship.

22:37.440 --> 22:38.760
Others say…

22:41.880 --> 22:45.000
she is the reincarnation of your mother.

22:46.080 --> 22:48.240
I have sent men
to investigate these claims.

22:48.320 --> 22:51.320
But all we found
was a drunkard spreading the rumors.

22:52.960 --> 22:56.440
So, not one of these rumors

22:56.960 --> 22:59.280
suggests a romantic connection
between her and me?

23:01.760 --> 23:02.600
None at all.

23:05.280 --> 23:06.640
Let's do this.

23:06.720 --> 23:10.200
Send someone to that drunkard's usual spot

23:10.720 --> 23:12.000
and plant a new rumor for me.

23:15.600 --> 23:16.640
Your Highness,

23:17.360 --> 23:21.480
the King and Du Yan already know
Ji Yingying is your weakness.

23:22.320 --> 23:25.000
It is only a matter of time
before they use her against you.

23:26.960 --> 23:31.840
Doesn't having a weakness
make others trust me more?

23:32.440 --> 23:35.600
Your Highness,
if it is all a calculated act,

23:35.680 --> 23:36.760
then it is indeed advantageous.

23:37.760 --> 23:40.920
But I fear that
when the critical moment comes,

23:41.840 --> 23:43.840
and if you truly fall for her,

23:44.360 --> 23:45.840
it is you who will be hurt the most.

23:47.760 --> 23:51.480
Is there anything I truly feel happy about
that is not for fame or fortune?

23:51.560 --> 23:54.240
Someone I would risk everything to see,
or something I would do

23:54.320 --> 23:57.640
without caring about the outcome?

24:01.520 --> 24:05.440
How many years have I been planning
for Shu brocade?

24:05.520 --> 24:07.640
If you count from when
you first asked my father

24:07.720 --> 24:10.080
to purchase brocade from Yizhou,

24:11.000 --> 24:12.560
it has been at least ten years.

24:13.080 --> 24:15.560
I have waited ten years for brocade.

24:16.240 --> 24:19.760
Why not wait even longer for someone?

24:22.520 --> 24:27.240
Illusions will eventually
turn into a long-lasting reality.

24:28.080 --> 24:30.800
But the King has only given her a year.

24:30.880 --> 24:32.560
If the brocade cannot be completed…

24:32.640 --> 24:34.880
I believe she will weave it.

24:35.480 --> 24:37.800
If she does not,

24:37.880 --> 24:40.920
I will find another way to keep her here.

24:41.000 --> 24:43.440
It is because she and I are the same.

24:43.520 --> 24:44.760
We are people who,

24:44.840 --> 24:47.040
knowing something is impossible,
still choose to do it.

24:58.240 --> 25:02.520
PRINCE BAI'S RESIDENCE

25:14.240 --> 25:16.640
The physician has examined you.
There is nothing serious.

25:16.720 --> 25:17.720
Just rest well.

25:19.720 --> 25:22.920
I had these books and a desk brought over.

25:23.000 --> 25:25.360
When you have time,
you can look through them.

25:25.960 --> 25:27.520
This room is close to the kitchen.

25:27.600 --> 25:30.880
If you want anything to eat,
just let them know.

25:36.960 --> 25:39.880
Stop looking around.
I have my own chambers.

25:39.960 --> 25:40.800
I will not be staying here.

25:42.240 --> 25:45.360
Your body is still recovering
from the toxins.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.400
Rest well.

25:49.520 --> 25:50.560
Wait a moment!

25:57.680 --> 25:59.640
Can you do me a favor
and deliver something to Mu Lan?

26:09.520 --> 26:12.680
Tell her it is to thank her
for helping to detoxify me.

26:16.000 --> 26:20.040
I imagine the leaf
should look more like this.

26:28.480 --> 26:30.080
That would make it even harder to find.

26:49.200 --> 26:51.440
TIAN BU PA

27:03.720 --> 27:05.600
PATTERN

27:08.640 --> 27:09.720
Your Highness?

27:11.720 --> 27:12.800
Come in.

27:13.560 --> 27:16.400
Your Highness, this is a gift from Ms. Mu.

27:16.480 --> 27:17.560
Leave it here.

27:27.080 --> 27:28.040
It is quite similar.

27:29.520 --> 27:31.120
It does not look like
it was chewed by silkworms.

27:31.200 --> 27:32.480
Instead, it looks more like humans did it.

27:35.880 --> 27:38.680
TIAN BU PA

27:47.200 --> 27:48.880
Nanzhao does not have Huanhua Creek,

27:48.960 --> 27:50.280
but its dyeing techniques

27:50.360 --> 27:53.280
have its own unique characteristics
and color-fixing methods.

27:53.360 --> 27:54.880
I think we could incorporate
some of these methods

27:54.960 --> 27:57.080
into Shu brocade techniques.

27:57.760 --> 27:59.080
Maybe you could try this out?

28:00.320 --> 28:02.560
DYEING METHODS

28:04.160 --> 28:05.520
Have you read all these books?

28:07.440 --> 28:08.760
Some of them.

28:13.080 --> 28:15.040
Sheng, happy birthday.

28:15.800 --> 28:17.360
The owner of Shun'an Pavilion,
your favorite place,

28:17.440 --> 28:18.680
has returned to their hometown,

28:18.760 --> 28:21.320
so I tried making these pastries myself.

28:21.400 --> 28:22.760
I hope you like them.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.040
You are thoughtful.

28:31.560 --> 28:32.800
These are delicious.

28:34.000 --> 28:36.120
If you like them,
I will make more for you next time.

28:36.200 --> 28:37.280
That sounds wonderful.

28:45.040 --> 28:46.720
Do you know what day it is today?

28:46.800 --> 28:49.560
Are you pretending not to hear, Ms. Ji?

28:51.120 --> 28:53.000
Wishing you a very happy birthday,
Your Highness.

28:54.480 --> 28:57.680
Just a simple birthday greeting?

28:57.760 --> 28:58.600
No gift?

29:00.160 --> 29:01.000
How about this?

29:01.080 --> 29:03.320
We have just finished preparing a new dye.

29:03.400 --> 29:06.280
Why don't you draw something
using this dye

29:06.360 --> 29:08.400
as a birthday gift for me?

29:18.240 --> 29:20.160
This is…

29:20.240 --> 29:21.680
- A peach.
- Peach?

29:24.000 --> 29:25.080
Fine.

29:25.160 --> 29:26.600
A peach it is.

29:28.240 --> 29:30.040
Your gift is accepted.

29:36.560 --> 29:38.200
I have finished reading the books
you gave me, Your Highness.

29:38.280 --> 29:40.920
The pigments I need
have also been collected.

29:42.120 --> 29:44.520
When will you allow me
to visit the weaving workshop

29:44.600 --> 29:45.560
to see my companions?

29:53.040 --> 29:54.520
I thought

29:55.040 --> 29:57.560
we were getting along rather well
during this time.

29:58.520 --> 30:00.400
As work partners, yes.

30:03.840 --> 30:04.880
And as something else?

30:06.640 --> 30:08.000
Sheng Fengze.

30:08.520 --> 30:09.440
If from the start,

30:09.520 --> 30:11.160
you and I had been discussing
business as equals,

30:12.240 --> 30:15.600
if our visit to Nanzhao
had been an invitation to weave brocade,

30:15.680 --> 30:17.960
perhaps things could have been different.

30:18.480 --> 30:19.400
Perhaps we could have been friends.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.880
But you chose a different path.

30:24.360 --> 30:27.040
Now, there is
an unbridgeable divide between us.

30:27.120 --> 30:28.760
Right or wrong, life or death.

30:29.720 --> 30:32.120
No matter what you do
or how long you persist,

30:33.080 --> 30:35.280
I will never truly accept you.

30:42.600 --> 30:45.040
Today is my birthday.

30:45.680 --> 30:48.320
Can you say something
more pleasant to my ears?

30:50.400 --> 30:52.440
I have already said
everything that needs to be said.

31:04.280 --> 31:07.200
Since you have given me a gift today,

31:08.320 --> 31:09.520
I will return the favor

31:11.560 --> 31:13.240
with one of my own.

31:29.280 --> 31:33.240
The rumors about you in Nanzhao
have changed again.

31:33.320 --> 31:36.320
From being a reincarnated deity

31:36.840 --> 31:38.840
to a celestial silkworm spirit,

31:38.920 --> 31:43.320
and now, to being a Nanzhao officer.

31:47.400 --> 31:52.320
But there are no longer any rumors
that you are my wife.

31:53.240 --> 31:55.040
The earlier rumors

31:55.560 --> 31:58.680
were part of Du Yan and Niu Jin's schemes.

31:58.760 --> 32:03.280
But these later ones
remind me of an old friend.

32:06.080 --> 32:07.080
That is why

32:07.800 --> 32:09.800
I have spread a rumor of my own.

32:09.880 --> 32:10.840
It goes like this.

32:11.960 --> 32:13.440
Ji Yingying, a craftswoman from Yizhou,

32:13.520 --> 32:17.040
accompanied me up the mountain,
where we were ambushed.

32:17.120 --> 32:18.080
Her fate remains uncertain.

32:21.000 --> 32:23.360
A rumor so full of holes

32:23.440 --> 32:26.280
could only make people laugh.

32:26.360 --> 32:28.080
- It is impossible to take seriously.
- True.

32:28.680 --> 32:31.720
For those who are indifferent,
it is just a joke.

32:31.800 --> 32:34.880
But for those with feelings and loyalty,

32:35.640 --> 32:37.320
it is a different matter altogether.

32:39.040 --> 32:40.960
After all, for someone
who truly loves another,

32:41.480 --> 32:42.520
even the smallest risk
to their beloved's life

32:42.600 --> 32:44.240
cannot be ignored.

32:44.760 --> 32:48.240
No matter how slim the chance,
they will investigate.

32:54.760 --> 32:55.960
Yang…

33:13.680 --> 33:14.560
It is you!

33:15.520 --> 33:16.360
You tricked me!

33:17.680 --> 33:19.640
How could I betray His Highness?

33:19.720 --> 33:21.320
You were too naive!

34:09.199 --> 34:11.480
His Highness has already set a trap.

34:11.560 --> 34:12.920
There is no escape for you now.

34:13.000 --> 34:14.080
Yang Jinglan!

34:15.320 --> 34:16.360
Yingying!

34:22.159 --> 34:23.120
Yingying,

34:24.080 --> 34:24.920
are you all right?

34:26.120 --> 34:27.360
The rumors were false.

34:29.080 --> 34:30.560
Mr. Yang, after arriving in Nanzhao,

34:30.639 --> 34:32.920
you should have visited
my residence openly.

34:33.000 --> 34:35.840
I could have hosted you properly.

34:35.920 --> 34:39.840
Your Highness, your hospitality
leaves much to be desired.

34:39.920 --> 34:42.440
Who asked you to break
the guest code first?

34:43.040 --> 34:45.120
Sheng Fengze, let him go!

34:45.199 --> 34:46.600
Yingying, do not be afraid.

34:48.280 --> 34:49.320
He will not dare kill me.

34:51.360 --> 34:53.280
Given your connections
to the crown prince,

34:53.360 --> 34:56.400
I did tread carefully around you
in Yizhou.

34:57.120 --> 34:58.720
But now, you are in Nanzhao

34:59.320 --> 35:00.880
and trespassing my residence at night.

35:00.960 --> 35:03.240
If I were to kill you,
it would be entirely justified.

35:03.320 --> 35:05.920
Your Highness,
this trap is not particularly clever.

35:06.000 --> 35:07.760
It is simply a gamble on my feelings.

35:07.840 --> 35:09.720
You knew it was a trap,
yet you came anyway?

35:11.680 --> 35:13.000
I could not risk the slightest chance
of something happening to you.

35:16.440 --> 35:17.640
Sheng Fengze,

35:18.600 --> 35:20.600
if I dared to infiltrate
your residence at night,

35:20.680 --> 35:24.200
how do you know I came unprepared?

35:27.000 --> 35:29.960
Did you think I did not know
about your collaboration with Du Yan?

35:32.680 --> 35:34.360
But have you ever considered this?

35:34.880 --> 35:38.280
While Ji Yingying is here with me,
her life is, at least, not in danger.

35:39.400 --> 35:41.000
If she goes to the weaving workshop,

35:41.080 --> 35:43.000
do you know what she will face there?

35:43.080 --> 35:44.880
You and Du Yan
are cut from the same cloth!

35:55.480 --> 35:56.640
Sheng Fengze,

35:57.760 --> 35:58.960
if you kill me today,

35:59.960 --> 36:00.800
you will not only bear

36:00.880 --> 36:02.800
the crime of murdering
the military commissioner of Yizhou,

36:03.520 --> 36:05.280
but also add the charge

36:05.360 --> 36:07.320
of killing a subordinate
of the crown prince.

36:07.840 --> 36:11.560
I am sure Qingping Officer
would love such an opportunity

36:11.640 --> 36:13.320
to root out all threats.

36:13.400 --> 36:16.120
You are betting
that I do not dare to kill you.

36:17.280 --> 36:18.400
Do you dare?

36:26.120 --> 36:27.720
If you kill him,

36:29.120 --> 36:30.280
then kill me as well.

36:39.320 --> 36:41.320
I am gambling on your feelings for him,

36:42.280 --> 36:44.280
and you are gambling on mine for you.

36:46.040 --> 36:47.040
Fine.

36:47.920 --> 36:49.840
If you both love gambling so much,

36:49.920 --> 36:52.040
I will indulge you today.

36:52.560 --> 36:53.840
Let's have a proper wager.

37:31.600 --> 37:34.360
I am no good at chess. This is not fair.

37:35.040 --> 37:36.920
To Mr. Yang,

37:37.000 --> 37:39.800
these sacrificial soldiers
are not exactly skilled in combat.

37:41.080 --> 37:43.320
Ms. Ji, if you do not wish to gamble,

37:43.400 --> 37:47.280
I can always give the order
to unleash the volley of arrows.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.000
I will ensure he dies here.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.840
How do you want to gamble?

38:06.800 --> 38:09.000
I will assign 12 sacrificial soldiers

38:09.840 --> 38:11.400
to spar with Mr. Yang.

38:12.680 --> 38:16.120
For every piece you win on the board,
I will withdraw one soldier.

38:16.800 --> 38:18.440
But for every piece I win,

38:18.960 --> 38:20.680
I will add one more.

38:20.760 --> 38:22.880
The game continues
until a victor is decided.

38:26.320 --> 38:28.680
If I kill them all,

38:29.720 --> 38:30.880
does that count as our win?

38:33.240 --> 38:34.800
That depends on your ability.

38:40.120 --> 38:42.480
Ms. Ji, let's start.

39:04.640 --> 39:05.600
Yingying,

39:06.320 --> 39:07.320
do not worry.

39:07.840 --> 39:09.760
These men cannot harm me.

39:13.480 --> 39:14.480
Sheng Fengze!

39:14.560 --> 39:15.840
I have already said,

39:17.200 --> 39:20.640
12 men is my limit.

39:25.360 --> 39:26.200
Shall we begin?

40:54.640 --> 40:58.000
I advise you to focus, Ms. Ji.

40:58.080 --> 41:00.960
Mr. Yang's life rests in your hands.

41:46.480 --> 41:48.440
This game leaves no path to survival!

41:49.160 --> 41:51.520
Sheng Fengze, stop it!

41:51.600 --> 41:54.920
If you kill him, I will join him in death.

41:55.000 --> 41:56.560
I mean what I say.

42:14.080 --> 42:15.000
Stop!

42:31.720 --> 42:32.560
Chi Hu!

42:33.080 --> 42:34.000
Here!

42:35.240 --> 42:38.080
Lock them in the weaving workshop.

42:39.240 --> 42:41.320
They are not to see
each other again, in life or death.

42:42.080 --> 42:43.280
Understood.
